{"questions":[{"question_id":"mQtKgnd5d0bYdKra","paperTitle":"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 2 Offline","year":2011,"examDate":2011,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"chemical-kinetics-and-nuclear-chemistry","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","topic":"integrated-rate-law-equations","type":"mcqm","marks":3,"negMarks":0.75,"permalink":"for-the-first-order-reaction-2n2o5-g-to-4no2-g-o2-2011-marks-3-mqtkgnd5d0bydkra.htm","content":"For the first order reaction<br>\n2N<sub>2</sub>O<sub>5</sub> (g) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 4NO<sub>2</sub> (g) + O<sub>2</sub> (g)","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"the concentration of the reactant decreases exponentially with time"},{"identifier":"B","content":"the half-life of the reaction decreases with increasing temperature"},{"identifier":"C","content":"the half-life of the reaction depends on the initial concentration of the reactant"},{"identifier":"D","content":"the reaction proceeds to 99.6% completion in eight half-life duration"}],"correct_options":["A","B","D"],"explanation":"<p>The given chemical equation represents a first-order reaction: </p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30.041ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 13278.2 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1739.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2939.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3328.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D454\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D454\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3808.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4474.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5752.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6252.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7140.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8340.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(8729.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D454\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D454\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9209.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9820.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10820.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12020.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(12409.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D454\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D454\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12889.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>In first-order reactions, the rate of reaction is directly proportional to the concentration of the reactant. The rate law can be expressed as:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.757ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 6964.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(759,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1288,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1649,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2392.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3448.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3969.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4247.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(5487.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6686.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>where <i>k</i> is the rate constant.</p>\n\n<p>The integrated rate equation for a first-order reaction is:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27.852ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 12310.8 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(834,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(834,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1112,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2351.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3551.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4106.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5162.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5940.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6461.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7044.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(8045.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8879.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8879.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(9157.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10396.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(11596.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>where <i>[N_2O_5]_0</i> is the initial concentration and <i>[N_2O_5]</i> is the concentration at time <i>t</i>.</p>\n\n<p>Rearranging gives:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.455ex\" height=\"2.497ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -853.7 9483.1 1103.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1517.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2717.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3272.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4328.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4606.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(5846.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7045.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(7760.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(499,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1299,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Now, let's analyze each option:</p>\n\n<p><b>Option A:</b> \"the concentration of the reactant decreases exponentially with time\".</p>\n\n<p>This matches the expression <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.455ex\" height=\"2.497ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -853.7 9483.1 1103.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1517.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2717.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3272.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4328.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4606.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(5846.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7045.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(7760.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(499,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1299,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> which shows an exponential decline in the concentration of the reactant. Therefore, option A is <b>correct</b>.</p>\n\n<p><b>Option B:</b> \"the half-life of the reaction decreases with increasing temperature\".</p>\n\n<p>In first-order reactions, the half-life is determined by the equation <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.8ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.69ex\" height=\"2.757ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 5167 1218.4\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(394,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1782.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2838.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(841.2,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><rect width=\"1810.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4889,0)\"><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Increases in temperature typically increase the rate constant <i>k</i>, thus decreasing the half-life. However, it is not directly related to the half-life itself but rather to the rate constant via the Arrhenius equation. Nonetheless, the essence of the statement is <b>correct</b> as increasing temperature generally decreases the half-life.</p>\n\n<p><b>Option C:</b> \"the half-life of the reaction depends on the initial concentration of the reactant\".</p>\n\n<p>The half-life for a first-order reaction given by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.8ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.061ex\" height=\"2.757ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 4889 1218.4\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(394,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1782.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2838.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(841.2,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><rect width=\"1810.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is independent of the initial concentration [N_2O_5]_0. Therefore, option C is <b>incorrect</b>.</p>\n\n<p><b>Option D:</b> \"the reaction proceeds to 99.6% completion in eight half-life durations\".</p>\n\n<p>Completion to a certain level can be found using the formula for decay over multiple half-lives, given as <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.791ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"25.338ex\" height=\"2.837ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -904.5 11199.6 1254\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1517.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2717.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3272.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4328.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4606.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(836,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(5846.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7045.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7982.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(8982.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(458,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1251.6,0) translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-29\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1742.6,592) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> where <i>n</i> is the number of half-lives. For eight half-lives, we have:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"56.077ex\" height=\"3.221ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1062.9 24786.1 1423.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(749,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1094,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1694,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2223,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(2521,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2688,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3448,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\